<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 359.56 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tues.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 359.56 mln rand S.Africa bonds Tues.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 359.56 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Tuesday, after buying 173.86 million rand on Monday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
